            Expect <strong class="text-white">four to seven years</strong>, and expect to fit a <strong class="text-white">new battery at three to five</strong> — that single $50 to $120 part is what turns a machine that covers half the floor back into one that covers all of it.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
